      "id": "sol.amc-8-2016-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "There are \\(60\\) minutes in an hour, so the total time is \\(60 \\cdot 11 + 5 = 665\\) minutes.\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
